# Build context hygiene (A1-P1).
#
# app/ is the Docker build context (`docker build -t theygrow-app app`), and the
# parity suite lives in this subtree. Without this file a local app/node_modules/
# would be shipped to the Docker daemon on every build.
#
# This does NOT change the built image: app/Dockerfile COPYs an explicit file
# list (nginx.conf, index.html, kb-v1.json, manifest.json, icons/, sw.js,
# offline.html) and none of the paths below are in it. The image is byte-identical
# with or without this file; only the context transferred to the daemon shrinks.

node_modules/
tests/
package.json
package-lock.json
playwright.config.js
.dockerignore

# Playwright run output (also gitignored)
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
